<title>HONG KONG: HK August merchandise trade figures.</title>
<headline>HK August merchandise trade figures.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department released the following figures for merchandise trade (rounded figures in billions of H.K. dollars and year-on-year percentage change) (*** denotes less than 0.05 percent)</p>
<p>					 August 1996	 July 1996</p>
<p>Re-exports to the five main destinations</p>
<p> China				 34.41 (+ 7.4)    37.57 (+13.5)</p>
<p> U.S.				  25.22 (+ 9.4)    25.49 (+11.6)</p>
<p> Japan				  7.32 (+12.7)     6.85 (+16.3)</p>
<p> Germany				4.38 (+ 4.0)     3.66 (+26.6)</p>
<p> U.K.				   3.44 (+ 5.5)     4.49 (+10.6)</p>
<p>					 August 1996	 July 1996</p>
<p>Domestic exports to the five main destinations</p>
<p> China				  5.29 (- 4.9)    5.60 (- 1.9)</p>
<p> U.S.				   4.70 (-15.2)    5.58 (- 9.0)</p>
<p> Japan				  0.96 (- 8.5)    1.01 (- 5.2)</p>
<p> Germany				1.01 (- 5.8)    0.84 (-20.9)</p>
<p> Singapore			    0.74 (-29.4)    1.36 (- 2.3)</p>
<p>					 August 1996	 July 1996</p>
<p>Imports from the five main suppliers</p>
<p> China				 54.03 (+ 9.0)    54.04 (+ 9.4)</p>
<p> Japan				 16.09 (-13.0)    18.94 (- 3.5)</p>
<p> Taiwan				10.08 (- 7.9)    11.00 (- 1.8)</p>
<p> U.S.				  10.81 (+ 9.5)     9.70 (-11.0)</p>
<p> Singapore			    6.30 (-21.8)     7.41 (+20.8)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
